+// DroidMount (lazy-reads) strategy thresholds.
+//
+// Files at or under FULL_PULL_MAX are pulled in full on first read: one adb
+// call, then every subsequent read is a fast local pread. Above it we stay
+// on dd range reads (cheap peeks: thumbnails / Quick Look of a big video)
